  #line-at(90pt, 255.84pt, "Abstract ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(114pt, 280.32pt, "Accurate evaluation of buried thermal interfaces is vital for understanding and ")
  #line-at(90pt, 304.8pt, "optimizing heat dissipation in wide- and ultra-wide-bandgap (WBG/UWBG) ")
  #line-at(90pt, 329.28pt, "semiconductor devices. Conventional time-domain thermoreflectance (TDTR) ")
  #line-at(90pt, 353.76pt, "typically probes only near-surface transport due to its restricted modulation frequency ")
  #line-at(90pt, 378.24pt, "range. Here, we employ a frequency-tunable periodic waveform analysis TDTR (PWA-")
  #line-at(90pt, 402.48pt, "TDTR) technique to perform depth-resolved thermal measurements on three ")
  #line-at(90pt, 426.96pt, "representative systems: epitaxial ε-Ga")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.92pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(282.558pt, 427.92pt, "2")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(286.558pt, 426.96pt, "O")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.92pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(295.224pt, 427.92pt, "3")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(299.224pt, 426.96pt, "/SiC, GaN/Si, and mechanically bonded ")
  #line-at(90pt, 451.44pt, "GaN/diamond. By combining broadband multi-frequency probing with sensitivity-")
  #line-at(90pt, 475.92pt, "guided joint fitting, we quantitively determine interfacial thermal conductance, layer-")
  #line-at(90pt, 500.4pt, "specific thermal conductivity, and volumetric heat capacity, without requiring ")
  #line-at(90pt, 524.88pt, "destructive sample preparation. The results reveal that the buried Ga")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.92pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(421.853pt, 525.84pt, "2")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(425.853pt, 524.88pt, "O")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 7.92pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(434.519pt, 525.84pt, "3")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 12pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
  #line-at(438.519pt, 524.88pt, "/SiC interface ")
  #line-at(90pt, 549.36pt, "exhibits weak phonon transmission due to acoustic mismatch; the transition layers in ")
  #line-at(90pt, 573.84pt, "GaN/Si act as phonon-impedance gradients that redistribute heat flux; and the ")
  #line-at(90pt, 598.08pt, "GaN/diamond boundary remains the dominant thermal bottleneck despite diamond’s ")
  #line-at(90pt, 622.56pt, "ultrahigh bulk conductivity. These findings demonstrate that the modulation frequency ")
  #line-at(90pt, 647.04pt, "in PWA-TDTR functions as a tunable probe of depth-dependent phonon transport, ")
  #line-at(90pt, 671.52pt, "directly linking frequency-domain thermal response to interfacial energy transmission. ")
  #line-at(90pt, 696pt, "Overall, this work positions PWA-TDTR as a versatile platform for investigating buried ")
  #line-at(90pt, 720.48pt, "nonmetal–nonmetal interfaces in next-generation high-power and optoelectronic ")
  #line-at(90pt, 744.96pt, "materials.  ")
]

